    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Fake Review Detection Platform — AnalyzeG","url":"https://analyzeg.co.in/solutions/fake-review-detection.html","mainEntity":{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How does AnalyzeG detect fake reviews?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AnalyzeG prevents fake reviews at the source through 5-point verification: face-presence check (real person visible), device integrity, geo-consistency, content checklist, and timestamp validation — plus human moderation. Only verified reviews enter the sellable pool. This is fundamentally different from detecting fakes after they are posted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is face-presence verification?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Face-presence verification confirms that a real person is visible in the video review. It checks for consistent face presence throughout the 30-second clip, preventing screen recordings, slideshows, or AI-generated content from passing as genuine reviews."}}]}}</script>
  </Fragment>
  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #1e40af 100%); color: white; padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;"><div class="container"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;">Platform Live Now</span></div></div>
  <header class="navbar" role="banner"><div class="container"><div class="logo-container"><a href="/" class="logo"><img src="/assets/optimized/192X192_ONLYLOGO_BACKGROUNDLESS.svg" alt="AnalyzeG" width="40" height="40"><span class="logo-text">AnalyzeG</span></a></div><button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle nav" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-nav"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button><nav id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation" role="navigation" aria-hidden="true"><ul role="menubar"><li role="none"><a href="/" role="menuitem">Home</a></li><li role="none"><a href="/features.html" role="menuitem">Platform</a></li><li role="none"><a href="/for-reviewers" role="menuitem">For Reviewers</a></li><li role="none"><a href="/about.html" role="menuitem">About</a></li><li role="none"><a href="/trust.html" role="menuitem">Trust Center</a></li><li role="none"><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" class="nav-cta" role="menuitem" rel="noopener">Launch App</a></li></ul></nav></div></header>
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">SOLUTIONS</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Fake Review Detection</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">Stop detecting fakes after they are posted. Prevent them at the source with verified video reviews.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
    <section style="background:#fff; padding:60px 0;"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Fake Review Problem</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:#475569; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Fake reviews cost businesses billions. In India, consumers increasingly distrust text reviews because they know fake ones exist. Detection tools try to identify fakes after they are posted — but by then the damage is done.</p>
      <p style="font-size:1.05rem; color:#475569; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:2rem;">AnalyzeG takes a different approach: prevent fakes at the source through 5-point verification before a review ever enters the pool.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">AnalyzeG's 5-Point Verification</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; gap:1rem; margin:2rem 0;">
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">1. Face-Presence Check</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Real person visible throughout the 30-second video. Prevents screen recordings, slideshows, and AI-generated content.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">2. Device Integrity</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Confirms video is recorded on a real device, not screen-recorded or downloaded.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">3. Geo-Consistency</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Location data matches reviewer profile and product category expectations.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">4. Content Checklist</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Video shows the actual product in-hand, in-use — not stock footage or screenshots.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #2563EB;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">5. Timestamp Validation</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Time-stamped with audit logs for compliance and dispute resolution.</p></div>
        <div style="background:#fef3c7; border-radius:8px; padding:1.25rem; border-left:4px solid #d97706;"><h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b;">+ Human Moderation</h3><p style="color:#64748b; font-size:0.95rem;">Every verified review is additionally reviewed by a human moderator before entering the sellable pool.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#f0f9ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:12px; padding:2rem; margin:2rem 0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e40af; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Get Verified Reviews, Not Detected Fakes</h3><p style="color:#475569; margin-bottom:1rem;">Projects starting at ₹5L. 5-point screening + human moderation. Final quote after scoping call.</p><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" style="display:inline-block; background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">Launch App &rarr;</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
